+# S5-CLM-00003516
+
+Complete Stage5 target package for the frozen declaration
+`Arxiv.«2602.05192».four_3` (Stage6 alias `S6-CLM-00008266`).
+
+The proof reduces the centered real-rooted cubic problem to a discriminant
+identity and a weighted Cauchy square. `proof-units.json` is the authoritative
+typed DAG; `proof-outline.md` gives its readable fragments; the three Lean
+files contain the claim-owned algebraic kernel. Provider source bytes are
+statement provenance only because the frozen declaration contains `sorryAx`.
+
+Release status is a worker-side provisional candidate. Canonical semantic
+recomputation and trust-zero compilation are Master-only acceptance gates.
